==Icelandic==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈpɛhkʏr/}}
*: {{rhymes|is|ɛhkʏr|s=2}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|is|non-own|bekkr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*bankiz}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun/old|m|bekks|gen2=bekkjar|bekkir}}

# a [[bench]]
# a [[class]] (in school)
#: {{uxi|is|Við erum saman í '''bekk'''.|We are classmates.}}
# a [[grade]], [[form]] (in school)
#: {{uxi|is|Hann er í fjórða '''bekk'''.|He's in fourth grade.}}
# {{lb|is|informal}} {{short for|is|bekkpressa|t=[[bench press]]|nocap=1}}
#: {{uxi|is|Ég tek 200 í '''bekk'''.|I am able to [[bench press]] 200 kg.}}

=====Declension=====
{{is-decl-noun-m-s2|b|e|kk|j=j|ar=?}}

