===Etymology 2===
From {{inh|is|non|bekkr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*bakjaz}}. A by-form of {{inh|is|gem-pro|*bakiz}}. Related to German {{m|de|Bach}}.

====Noun====
{{is-noun/old|m|bekks|gen2=bekkjar|bekkir}}

